{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52074","headline":"五言奉日侍宴望海应诏 · 郑仁轨","name":"五言奉日侍宴望海应诏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"御龙称曩载，仙驾纪前皇。\n直谓穷游览，非爲务省方。\n大君弘覆焘，禁暴抚遐荒。\n观兵临碣石，极目眺扶桑。\n周区廓灵府，接汉委归塘。\n淼淼经纶阔，悠悠控注长。\n标空□绝岛，跨日起飞梁。\n银阙浮朝气，金台映晚光。\n荡秽符神略，安流表会昌。\n徒欣奉奇观，倾蠡讵可量？\n（《翰林学士集》）（按：此诗原署「左宗卫率府长史弘文馆直学士臣郑仁轨上」。\n张步云《唐代逸诗辑存》收入。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑仁轨","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52074.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52074","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}